+// Launch wrapper for the fused plain LayerNorm + affine. Mirrors
+// rms_norm_mul_f32_cuda: when mul == nullptr it just runs the un-fused norm
+// (identical to norm_f32_cuda); when add == nullptr it does NORM+MUL; else it
